+            # If we're forwarding requests to an HTTPS proxy (rather than
+            # tunneling to the origin) then the TLS handshake we're about to
+            # perform is actually with the proxy, not the origin. In that
+            # case only 'proxy_ssl_context' (and the other proxy_* settings)
+            # should be used to establish the connection.
